Chivalry: Medieval Warfare is an excellent multiplayer game for PC. It is extremely fun, challenging and with a fantastic gameplay. This is my review about the game, here I'll write about the + points and - points. And in the end I'll gave my verdict.
+Combat Mechanic & Moviments;
+Social interation with a lot of fun;
+The dismember of bodies;
+Gamemodes are competitive;
-I miss a coop mode, like a surival;
Chivalry combine fun with bloody combats that challenge the player to make the best combination of moviments. The game doesn't limit himself to just strong and weak attacks. We have upper attacks and side attacks. The weapons goes since incendiary bombs to knife throwing. With 4 class, the game run in a perfect way, which you have to combine the habilites of your army to complete the objectives.
I recommend this game to everyone who like a FPS Medieval Warfare, or for the people who are sick of Cal of Duty.
Score: 9/10
